WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a wide squat or kneeling, begin to slide both feet out to the sides.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Support with hands on blocks in front of you.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the kneecaps and toes pointing up as much as possible.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Hips sink only as far as the inner thighs stay comfortable — no sharp pain.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Walk the feet in to exit and shake out the legs.
